        <detaileddescription>
<para>Builds <ref refid="classONNX__LIGHT__NAMESPACE_1_1NodeProto" kindref="compound">NodeProto</ref> entries from lightweight node definitions.</para>
<para>Example:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput>{{&quot;Z&quot;}, &quot;Add&quot;, {&quot;X&quot;, &quot;Y&quot;}}</computeroutput> models <computeroutput>Z = Add(X, Y)</computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>{{&quot;Y&quot;}, &quot;Concat&quot;, {&quot;X1&quot;, &quot;X2&quot;, &quot;X3&quot;}, {{&quot;axis&quot;, 1}}}</computeroutput> adds attributes (axis=1).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>{{&quot;Z&quot;}, &quot;Foo&quot;, {&quot;X&quot;, &quot;Y&quot;}, {}, &quot;customdomain&quot;}</computeroutput> targets a custom-domain operator.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
