<para><ref refid="structONNX__LIGHT__NAMESPACE_1_1Node" kindref="compound">Node</ref> definitions describing outputs, op type, inputs, and attributes. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Materialized nodes for a function body. </para>
